  "description": "Field-level encryption for Entity Framework Core — everything in one package. AES-GCM authenticated encryption, key rotation and tenant binding, blind-index and deterministic (searchable) columns, and convention-based AutoEncryption run without a license key. A license key unlocks the ML PII classifier, Crypto Sentinel decryption-anomaly monitoring, email/webhook alerting, and DPDP/GDPR-ready compliance reporting.",
